  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved soil carbon management in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, CIFOR will provide technical assistance o the Government of Indonesia; the Ministry of Environment and Forestry in this regard, to refine its Green House Gasses Accounting System, particularly in wetlands. The project will also support the International Tropical Peatland Center.</narrative>
  </description>
